3. POPE benchmark
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POPE (Polling-based Object Probing Evaluation), MIT License

    https://github.com/RUCAIBox/POPE

POPE is NOT redistributed here. The exploratory harness under
`exploratory/multi_model_eval/` downloads the split files on first run.

No result reported in the paper uses the upstream POPE files at all: every
evaluation uses the regenerated, image-disjoint probes produced by
`protocol/generate_coco_pope.py`. Sec. 5 of the paper explains why -- training on
POPE-derived data and evaluating on POPE leaks ~93% of evaluation pairs into
training.

