5. Methods reimplemented as baselines (exploratory only)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
`exploratory/decoding/` contains reimplementations, written from the published
descriptions, of decoding-side hallucination mitigations used as baselines: VCD
(Leng et al., CVPR 2024), DoLa (Chuang et al., 2024), OPERA (Huang et al., CVPR
2024), and the CHAIR metric (Rohrbach et al., EMNLP 2018). Please cite the
original papers if you use them. Absolute CHAIR values depend on the synonym
list and parser, so only relative comparisons against this implementation are
meaningful. None of these appear in the paper.
